  (text "POWER: USB-C breakout -> F1 1.1 A PTC -> D1 TVS -> +5V -> AMS1117-3.3. USB data via USBLC6 ESD to CH340C." (at 10.16 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a8f9bb83-dba5-4a7d-8bbd-3ddf8926a2e7))
  (text "MCU + USB-UART: CH340C in 3.3 V mode (V3 tied to VCC). DTR/RTS auto-reset. IO0 = BOOT, IO2 = status LED." (at 10.16 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c607d627-81fb-4dc6-bc17-9d0a49eb089a))
  (text "Strapping: IO0 pulled up, IO2 LED to GND (safe). IO12 and IO15 unused. IO5/IO14 only on J902 (inputs)." (at 10.16 254.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 66668a42-afa5-44bc-b575-fc24d55ee77e))
  (text "PORTS: XH 4P = 1 GND, 2 VP, 3 A, 4 B. VP = 3V3 or 5V by solder jumper (pin 1 side bridged), 0.5 A PTC per port." (at 304.8 10.16 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b4723902-cc91-4c13-8712-d019bdb46bd8))
  (text "Rn01 series A (330R) | Rn02 A pull-up | Rn03 A pull-down | Rn04 series B (1k) | Rn05 B pull-up | Rn06 / Cn01 B to GND (GPIO side). DNP = option footprint." (at 304.8 294.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9eee115b-d30b-453e-b9a3-0455c838daa8))
